   RowBox[{"[", "states", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "7cb3131d-67a1-8749-a2dd-9cf92678784a"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "and `BranchingUncertainty[state]` give branching statistics of a list of \
hypergraph states or of one state.",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
  "5235a3db-3f39-eb4f-8e10-5cf341abbf77"]
}], "Usage",
 CellID->22603921,ExpressionUUID->"064adedf-c5d3-f944-bfc4-1c06146367e2"],

Cell["\<\
For a states graph the statistics describe how many distinct successors \
explored states have; terminal states have none.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->988443768,ExpressionUUID->"3da338de-8d86-504e-9a90-c570f3c05994"]
}, Open  ]],

